/Title (Single\055zone\040zero\055dimensional\040model\040study\040for\040diesel\055fuelled\040homogeneous\040charge\040compression\040ignition\040\050HCCI\051\040engines\040using\040Cantera)
/Author (Abdul\040Aziz\040Hairuddin\054\040Talal\040Yusaf\054\040Andrew\040P\056\040Wandel)
/Subject (Homogeneous\040charge\040compression\040ignition\040\050HCCI\051\040engine\040technology\040is\040relatively\040new\040and\040the\040combustion\040behavior\040in\040an\040HCCI\040engine\040is\040difficult\040to\040predict\056\040The\040combustion\040is\040fully\040controlled\040by\040the\040chemical\040kinetics\040and\040the\040chemical\040reaction\040of\040the\040mixture\040is\040influenced\040by\040changing\040input\040parameters\056\040A\040zero\055dimensional\040single\055zone\040model\040was\040used\040to\040investigate\040the\040combustion\040behavior\040of\040a\040diesel\040engine\040operating\040in\040HCCI\040mode\056\040An\040open\040source\040chemical\040kinetics\040package\040from\040Cantera\040was\040used\040in\040this\040study\056\040The\040combustion\040behaviour\040can\040be\040observed\054\040where\040H2O2\040was\040fully\040decomposed\040during\040the\040main\040combustion\040event\056\040The\040time\040for\040H2O2\040to\040completely\040decompose\040into\040OH\040radicals\040was\040very\040short\054\040which\040was\040about\0405\260CA\056\040The\040combustion\040phasing\040was\040predicted\040in\040accordance\040with\040the\040experiment\056\040The\040auto\055ignition\040can\040be\040controlled\040by\040controlling\040the\040intake\040temperature\040or\040AFR\056\040The\040start\040of\040combustion\040was\040advanced\040by\040increasing\040the\040intake\040temperature\040from\04020\040to\04070\260C\040and\040reducing\040the\040AFR\040from\04058\040to\04029\056\040However\054\040reducing\040AFR\040will\040increase\040the\040in\055cylinder\040peak\040pressure\056\040In\040general\054\040a\040zero\055dimensional\040model\040is\040a\040useful\040and\040faster\040tool\040to\040predict\040the\040combustion\040phasing\056\040When\040coupled\040with\040chemical\040kinetics\054\040it\040provides\040more\040accurate\040results\056)
